WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.690
Five people work in a small office.

2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.610
Their pay, in thousands of
pounds a year, is eighteen,

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:11.050
nineteen, twenty, twenty-one,
and one hundred and fifty.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.290
That last one is the boss.

5
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.055
A job advert says the average
pay here is over forty-five

6
00:00:17.105 --> 00:00:18.510
thousand pounds.

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.650
Is that a fair picture of
a typical worker's pay?

8
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.360
In this mission, you'll find the
mean, the median and the mode.

9
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.930
You'll measure spread with the range.

10
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.450
And you'll choose the best
average for a set of data.

11
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.050
Your mission: decide which average
gives a fair picture of the

12
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:35.930
pay.
